`\n16:- `lines` -> `lineItems`\n17:- each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n18:- each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n19:- each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n20:- `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n21:- `shipTo.postal_code` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n22:- blank or null shipping method -> `standard`\n23:\n24:Unknown legacy fields should be preserved in `metadata.unknownFields` unless the PII policy excludes them.\n25:\n26:Errors from `convert_many` should include `index`, `path`, and `error`, and conversion should continue after bad records.\n27:\n28:Warnings:\n29:- `convert_many` should return `(converted, errors, warnings)` when warnings are present, or preserve backward compatibility by allowing callers to unpack the first two values.\n30:- A warning should include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n31:- Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n32:- The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788212091160},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_y6HQsG0HbeH2hMv0Jo1WX32m|fc_002ac5f35a660012016a95f37afc5487d2ac7da35cd268abb6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md#1DE8]\n1:# PII Policy\n2:\n3:Do not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n4:\n5:Excluded keys include:\n6:- `ssn`\n7:- `credit_card`\n8:- `card_number`\n9:- `cvv`\n10:- `phone_number`\n11:- `passport_number`\n12:\n13:Non-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md",